Double-click: nested brackets, on a newline, an unmatched open bracket at
EOF, and a single-line file with no trailing newline.
args: -R input

-- script --
-- input --
((y))
word
a(^D-- script --
startfile 0
dclick 0 1
dclick 0 5
dclick 0 13
exit
-- host --
Hversion 2
Hnewname tag=0
Hmovname tag=0 "input"
Hnewname tag=1
Hbindname tag=1
Hcurrent tag=1
Hmovname tag=1 "~~sam~~"
Hcheck0 tag=1
Hack
Hunlock
